<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/E (In the redesigned m-Indicator app, users land on a clean home screen with a search-focused layout where they can quickly enter their current location and destination. Transit options like bus, metro, and taxi are clearly organized under a unified visual section. Favorite routes are conveniently displayed for quick access. The navigation drawer has also been redesigned with a lighter aesthetic, rounded buttons, and improved visual hierarchy, making features like timetable updates, language selection, and feedback more discoverable and user-friendly.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
